// 011.10, 013.2: the end state of a program and of each scenario satisfies every invariant,
// with or without `//! explore`. A violation on the way is a report; a scenario that means to
// end in breach says so with `?!name().`.
//! expect-failed-claims: 2
Bool bad
Invariant never-bad When Not(bad()).
Scenario ends-in-breach {
  +bad().
}
Scenario breach-and-cure {
  +bad().
  -bad().
}
Scenario breach-that-is-meant {
  +bad().
  ?!never-bad().
}
+bad().
